{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の夜ブログ書きながら寝てしまったので、朝の投稿です(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、いつもコメントありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて握手してくださった方、初コメントさんもありがとうございます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださる方も少しずつ増えてきて、日奈嬉しいかぎりです♪\n( •ω•ฅ）.｡.:*♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回コメントで、「今までは、ぼっちだったりしたけど、最近ひなちまふぁみりーのみんなと仲良くなってお話する機会が増えて凄い幸せです。\n本当にみんな握手会、いい人で握手会の楽しみがまた一つ増えました。」\nとありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈の心がほっこりして、なんだか幸せな気持ちになりました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまふぁみりーさん..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん仲良くしてくださって、ありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん優しくて、素敵なふぁみりーさん達ばかりで日奈、とってもとっても嬉しいです‼♥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/08/08/1461098/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみりーさん大好き♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゅーうっ(o^^o)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁさぁ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はメンバー全員で、とある撮影をしています☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しくて、早くみなさんにお話ししたいなぁ～(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにホテルは、あすかとひめたんと一緒です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し早いですが、今日も撮影なのでこのへんで( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【8月4日noiさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【8月6日かなりん乃木坂】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【8月7日オリトさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆HAPPY BIRTHDAY☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になります様に☆*:.｡."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/08/08/1461098/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんとぱくっ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も皆さんにとって幸せであります様に☆*:.｡."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな"}],"source":"archive"}